Banned techniques:

- Beppi Glitch (freezing Beppi The Clown in his phase 2 form and finishing the fight);
- Sally Stageplay's phase 2 skip (finishing off Sally's phase 1 just before the alternate version of the fight would start, completely skipping phase 2);
- Luigi Swaps (on plane stages, weapon swapping on the same frame as pressing the EX button, allowing to shoot during the EX animation). The use of a Luigi Swap will result in a 4 second time penalty.

Allowed Techniques:

- Ribby and Croaks's Super Skip (skipping the roll animation that normally plays at the beginning of phase 2);
- Kaleva Swaps (Weapon swapping at any time during the EX animation on non-plane levels, allowing to shoot during it);
- Perfect lobbers (aiming a lobber Ex in-between an enemy's hitbox and the ground to deal double damage);
- Exiting to map at the same time as going through the door in The Tutorial;
- Shop Glitch (buying an item and exiting at the same time);
- Pulling up the equip menu during Porkrind's dialogue.
- Hitting off-screen hitboxes;
- Hitting overlapping hitboxes for double damage;
- Rumor Honeybottoms's quick kill (getting the knockout on Rumor Honeybottoms before going to third phase);
- Ninja Clip (pressing jump and EX on the same frame while against a wall or object, allowing to clip backwards through it)

Can be played on 1.2 or any more recent versions.

